#版权问题
*XICHOU*
betalens-factor/tdx/XICHOU/**
# XICHOU timing mining configuration is maintained as a first-class,
# reproducible workflow; keep only the new adapter/configs visible to Git.
!betalens-factor/tdx/XICHOU/
!betalens-factor/tdx/XICHOU/timing_mining/
!betalens-factor/tdx/XICHOU/timing_mining/**
!betalens-factor/tdx/XICHOU/factor_XICHOU_timing_mining.py
# Keep generated mining outputs ignored even though the timing config folder
# itself is explicitly unignored above.
betalens-factor/tdx/XICHOU/timing_mining/outputs/

